evals/configure-routes.eval.ts / routes.text:
I added a route resolver for `blog_post` in `prismic.config.json`:

```json
{
  "type": "blog_post",
  "path": "/blog/:category/:uid",
  "resolvers": { "category": "category" }
}
```

This maps the `:category` keyword to the `category` content-relationship field on the `blog_post` custom type, and `:uid` to the post's own UID — producing URLs like `/blog/engineering/my-first-post`.

